   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Pop saturation: very high saturation (0.54), dark median (~58), deep warm shadows (39,27,20), bold reds and yellows, warm skin (154,118,84 / hue 29), surreal-glossy fashion colour. Best for: Statement frames only: vivid lehengas, colourful mandap decor, fashion-style poses, bold-colour backdrops, night-time stage lighting. Use at reduced Amount (50-70%) on normal frames.</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
   </dc:description>
